<h3>Problem Solving Strategies (Derived from Solutions)</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Direct Calculation:</strong> For simple square roots or expressions, directly calculate the values. (Q1, Q5, Q6, Q8, Q14, Q20)</li>
